      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After hanging up with his friend Markus in Riga, Viktor Petrovich gathers his cooks around to share the gossip. He reveals that German once attacked a chef in Latvia out of jealousy and received mandatory psychiatric treatment. Let's listen to Barinov's dramatic account in Russian.",
